          "text": [
            "\n",
            "#################################################################\n",
            "#      CITY SURVEILLANCE AGENT - PS9                    #\n",
            "#      BITS Pilani WILP | GBFS Algorithm                #\n",
            "#################################################################\n",
            "=================================================================\n",
            "   PEAS DESCRIPTION - CITY SURVEILLANCE DRONE AGENT\n",
            "=================================================================\n",
            "\n",
            "  [Performance Measure]\n",
            "    - Cover ALL lanes (edges) exactly once\n",
            "    - Minimize total path length (distance travelled)\n",
            "    - Battery efficiency: avoid unnecessary repeated traversal\n",
            "    - Completeness: all tourist spots connected by surveilled lanes\n",
            "\n",
            "  [Environment]\n",
            "    - City of Chennai with tourist landmarks as nodes\n",
            "    - Lanes (roads) between landmarks as edges\n",
            "    - Graph is undirected (lanes can be traversed both ways)\n",
            "    - Static environment: landmarks and lanes do not change\n",
            "    - Fully observable: drone has complete map\n",
            "    - Deterministic: actions have predictable outcomes\n",
            "    - Discrete: finite set of locations and lanes\n",
            "\n",
            "  [Actuators]\n",
            "    - Propellers to move the drone between locations\n",
            "    - Camera to record surveillance footage of lanes\n",
            "    - Battery management system\n",
            "    - Navigation control system\n",
            "\n",
            "  [Sensors]\n",
            "    - GPS to track current position\n",
            "    - Camera to monitor the lanes\n",
            "    - Battery level sensor\n",
            "    - Edge traversal tracker (which lanes are covered)\n",
            "    - Proximity sensor for detecting nearby landmarks\n",
            "\n",
            "=================================================================\n",
            "\n",
            "=================================================================\n",
            "         ENVIRONMENTAL CHARACTERISTICS\n",
            "=================================================================\n",
            "\n",
            "  [Observable]\n",
            "    Fully Observable - drone has complete city map\n",
            "\n",
            "  [Agents]\n",
            "    Single Agent - only one drone is operating\n",
            "\n",
            "  [Deterministic]\n",
            "    Deterministic - moving A to B always same outcome\n",
            "\n",
            "  [Sequential]\n",
            "    Sequential - each move depends on previous moves\n",
            "\n",
            "  [Static]\n",
            "    Static - city map does not change during mission\n",
            "\n",
            "  [Discrete]\n",
            "    Discrete - finite set of locations and lanes\n",
            "\n",
            "  [Known]\n",
            "    Known - complete map available before agent starts\n",
            "\n",
            "=================================================================\n",
            "\n",
            "=================================================================\n",
            "         HEURISTIC FUNCTION EXPLANATION\n",
            "=================================================================\n",
            "\n",
            "  Heuristic: Number of Unvisited Edges at Current Node\n",
            "\n",
            "  Formula: h(n) = -(number of unvisited edges at node n)\n",
            "\n",
            "  Why this heuristic?\n",
            "  -------------------\n",
            "  Goal: Cover ALL lanes (edges) exactly once.\n",
            "\n",
            "  Logic:\n",
            "  - Nodes with MORE unvisited edges are MORE PROMISING to visit.\n",
            "  - By going to such nodes first, we avoid getting stranded\n",
            "    at a dead-end with many uncovered lanes far away.\n",
            "  - The negative sign converts it to work with Python's\n",
            "    min-heap (lower number = higher priority).\n",
            "\n",
            "  Example:\n",
            "  - Node A has 3 unvisited edges -> h(A) = -3 (high priority)\n",
            "  - Node B has 1 unvisited edge  -> h(B) = -1 (low priority)\n",
            "  - GBFS picks Node A first.\n",
            "    \n",
            "=================================================================\n",
            "\n",
            "  [INFO] Building Chennai city graph...\n",
            "\n",
